# Claude Code: settings.json is shared project config (checked in below); these are
# personal/machine-specific (settings.local.json accumulates this machine's own
# auto-approved permission rules, including local absolute paths) or ephemeral runtime
# state, never meant to be shared across branches or machines.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
